  "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-9\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><section class=\"vc_cta3-container\"><div class=\"vc_general vc_do_cta3 vc_cta3 vc_cta3-style-classic vc_cta3-shape-rounded vc_cta3-align-left vc_cta3-color-classic vc_cta3-icon-size-md vc_cta3-actions-bottom\"><div class=\"vc_cta3_content-container\"><div class=\"vc_cta3-content\"><p>For a limited time, we have increased the discount on self-pay gastric sleeve to $5000!&nbsp; <strong>Total package price is now $10,000.&nbsp;</strong> Certain restrictions apply.</p>\n</div><div class=\"vc_cta3-actions\"><div class=\"vc_btn3-container vc_btn3-inline vc_do_btn\"><a class=\"vc_general vc_btn3 vc_btn3-size-md vc_btn3-shape-rounded vc_btn3-style-3d vc_btn3-color-grey\" href=\"https://journeylite.com/self-pay-gastric-sleeve-only-10000/\" title=\"\">Click for details!</a></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"vc_btn3-container vc_btn3-center vc_do_btn\"><a class=\"vc_general vc_btn3 vc_btn3-size-lg vc_btn3-shape-round vc_btn3-style-3d vc_btn3-color-violet\" href=\"http://journeylite.com/financing-options/\" title=\"Pricing &amp; Self Pay Options\" target=\"_blank\">Explore Financing Options</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/04/shutterstock_sleeve-150x150.jpg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-thumbnail\" alt=\"vertical sleeve gastrectomy\" title=\"gastric sleeve\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/04/shutterstock_sleeve-150x150.jpg.webp 150w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/04/shutterstock_sleeve-500x500.jpg.webp 500w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/04/shutterstock_sleeve-180x180.jpg.webp 180w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/04/shutterstock_sleeve-660x660.jpg.webp 660w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/04/shutterstock_sleeve-300x300.jpg.webp 300w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/04/shutterstock_sleeve-768x768.jpg.webp 768w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/04/shutterstock_sleeve-144x144.jpg.webp 144w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/04/shutterstock_sleeve-50x50.jpg.webp 50w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/04/shutterstock_sleeve-100x100.jpg.webp 100w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/04/shutterstock_sleeve.jpg.webp 1000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\"></div>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><h1 style=\"font-size: 60px;text-align: right\" class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading vc_custom_1556114606443\">Save $1000 on self-pay gastric sleeve procedures!</h1>\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">*Limited time offer, price subject to change without notice.</p>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n<div class=\"vc_empty_space\" style=\"height: 60px\"><span class=\"vc_empty_space_inner\"></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: left;\">JourneyLite Surgery Center is a leading facility for surgical weight loss in the midwest.&nbsp; Our surgeons have done thousands of gastric sleeve procedures and are proud of our ability to combine excellent care with affordable pricing for self-pay patients.&nbsp; We are happy to announce that, for a limited time, we will be offering $1000 off of our already-low procedure price of $14,900.&nbsp; That’s right, for just $13,900 your surgeon’s fee, anesthesia fee, and facility fee is covered, along with one year of post-op office care.&nbsp; This price can’t be beat and will be for a limited time, so call us now or request a consultation!</p>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n<div class=\"vc_btn3-container vc_btn3-center vc_do_btn\"><a class=\"vc_general vc_btn3 vc_btn3-size-lg vc_btn3-shape-round vc_btn3-style-3d vc_btn3-block vc_btn3-color-blue\" href=\"http://journeylite.com/appointment-request/\" title=\"Weight Loss Appointment Request\">Request Appointment Now!</a></div><section class=\"vc_cta3-container\"><div class=\"vc_general vc_do_cta3 vc_cta3 vc_cta3-style-3d vc_cta3-shape-rounded vc_cta3-align-center vc_cta3-color-turquoise vc_cta3-icon-size-md\"><div class=\"vc_cta3_content-container\"><div class=\"vc_cta3-content\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Cincinnati: (513) 559-1222<br>\nDayton: (937) 280-LOSE<br>\nColumbus: (614) 526-4463<br>\nNorthern KY: (859) 331-1035</p>\n</div></div></div></section></div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column